The '''Forest Temple''' is a sub-location of the [[Murkwater Depths]]. {{Zone|Ancient Ruins}} lantern puzzle must be completed to enter.

{{ZoneText|The Altar of an ancient being.}}

== Features ==
The '''Forest Temple''' is an underwater temple where players can donate {{c}} and {{Item|Enchanted Fig Log}}s to gain {{Stat|Foraging Fortune}} and become a temporary benefactor.

=== Puzzle ===
The player must rotate cyan glazed terracotta on the floor until it matches the pattern on the wall. Solving the '''Forest Temple's''' puzzle reactivates the temple grants {{stat|Foraging Fortune}} based on how many players have also reactivated the temple.

=== Bonuses ===
The player can donate {{C|70,000}} and {{Item|Enchanted Fig Log|amount=2}}s to become a {{Blue|Benefactor}} for one real-life day. This doubles the {{Stat|Foraging Fortune}} gained and makes thrown [[Axes]] {{Green|25%}} larger and faster. The player will lose their status as a {{Blue|Benefactor}} of the {{zone|Desert Temple}} if they were one, however, the time that this donation would have lasted will not be lost and rather added to the time as '''Forest Temple''' {{Blue|Benefactor}}.

